{
 "source": "U.S. National Library of Medicine, The Visible Human Project (public domain): his colour cryosections at full resolution (0.33 mm, NCI Imaging Data Commons) re-streamed by scripts/cryo/vhm_stream_leg_crops.py; his thigh muscles from build/vh/vhm_both = the DU lower-extremity release (Andreassen TE et al., Sci Data 10:34 (2023), doi:10.1038/s41597-022-01905-2, CC BY 4.0) as recovered from his published viewer v25; his sciatic nerve from Q57 (data/ct_sources/task_outputs/vhm_nerves_cryo.nii.gz, scripts/cryo/vhf_nerve_track.py + vhf_nerve_volume.py).",
 "subject": "ct_vhm_thigh_snap",
